[6:30AM]  #V_Island
#TrafficUpdate
The earlier reported impediment at Bonny Camp roundabout has a negative effect on the flow of traffic, causing traffic backlog to MC Ewen bridge which might possibly extend beyond.
Officers on ground managing the situation.
Patience is also required from the road users pending the full recovery.
