[5:39AM]  #V_Island
#BonnyCamp
#AccidentReport

A tipper loaded with Granite fell and spilled its contents at Bonny camp roundabout to connect Ozumba Mbadiwe.

A tow truck is already on standby and our personnel are firmly at the location doing the needful.
It's expected to be evacuated soon.
